      "id": "frameworks",
      "type": "pipeline",
      "duration_s": 6,
      "narration": [
        "Agent frameworks can feel like magic.",
        "LangChain, Strands, LangGraph: underneath, they all run the same small loop.",
        "Each turn, the model either asks for a tool, or gives a final answer."
      ],
      "data": {
        "head": "Under every framework",
        "inputs": [
          "LangChain",
          "Strands",
          "LangGraph"
        ],
        "model": "the same loop",
        "stages": [
          "asks for a tool",
          "final answer"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "loop",
      "type": "loop",
      "duration_s": 10,
      "narration": [
        "Here's the whole agent, with one task: use the calculator for 21 times 2.",
        "The loop sends the messages to the model.",
        "Instead of answering, the model asks for a tool: calculator, 21 times 2.",
        "Your code runs that tool, and appends the result, 42, to the messages.",
        "Then it loops. This time the model has what it needs, and answers: 42.",
        "That's it: a while loop, a list of messages, and a few plain functions."
      ],
      "data": {
        "nodes": {
          "chat": "chat()",
          "decide": "tool calls?",
          "run": "run tool",
          "append": "append result",
          "final": "final answer"
        },
        "messages": [
          {
            "role": "system",
            "text": "Solve the task. Use tools when helpful. Be brief."
          },
          {
            "role": "user",
            "text": "Use the calculator tool for 21 * 2."
          },
          {
            "role": "assistant",
            "text": "calculator(expression=\"21*2\")",
            "code": true
          },
          {
            "role": "tool",
